{"sha": "83e048c00638dff6d5a037660208fb3749ad135113d453f24f0c609e3fc64ec5", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:complex} 章 --- 复数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:1}", "$(3-2\\iu)(1+4\\iu) = 3 + 12\\iu - 2\\iu - 8\\iu^2 = 11 + 10\\iu$.", "", "$\\dfrac{2+\\iu}{1-\\iu} = \\dfrac{(2+\\iu)(1+\\iu)}{(1-\\iu)(1+\\iu)}", "= \\dfrac{1 + 3\\iu}{2} = \\dfrac12 + \\dfrac32\\iu$.", "", "$\\iu^{2027}$：由 $\\iu^4 = 1$ 及 $2027 = 4 \\times 506 + 3$，", "$\\iu^{2027} = \\iu^3 = -\\iu$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:2}", "\\emph{(a)} $\\Delta = 16 - 52 = -36$：", "$z = \\dfrac{4 \\pm 6\\iu}{2} = 2 \\pm 3\\iu$。二者为共轭复数，其积", "$= 4 + 9 = 13 = \\frac ca$。\\emph{(b)} $\\Delta = 1 - 4 = -3$：", "$z = \\dfrac{-1 \\pm \\iu\\sqrt3}{2}$（即单位立方根 $j$ 与", "$\\conj j$），其积 $= \\frac{1 + 3}{4} = 1$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:3}", "$\\abs{z_1} = \\sqrt2$，辐角为 $\\frac{3\\pi}{4}$（第二象限）：", "$z_1 = \\sqrt2\\,\\eu^{3\\iu\\pi/4}$.", "$\\abs{z_2} = 2$，辐角为 $-\\frac\\pi6$：", "$z_2 = 2\\,\\eu^{-\\iu\\pi/6}$。于是", "\\[", "\\frac{z_1}{z_2} = \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4} + \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)}", "= \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\,\\eu^{11\\iu\\pi/12}.", "\\]", "用代数形式计算，", "\\[", "\\frac{z_1}{z_2} = \\frac{-1+\\iu}{\\sqrt3 - \\iu}", "= \\frac{(-1+\\iu)(\\sqrt3+\\iu)}{4}", "= \\frac{-\\sqrt3 - 1 + \\iu(\\sqrt3 - 1)}{4}.", "\\]", "比较实部可得：", "$\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\\cos\\frac{11\\pi}{12} = \\frac{-\\sqrt3-1}{4}$，于是", "\\[", "\\cos\\frac{11\\pi}{12} = -\\frac{\\sqrt6 + \\sqrt2}{4}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:4}", "\\emph{(a)} $\\abs{z - 2} = \\abs{z - (-\\iu)}$ 表示点 $M$ 到", "$A(2, 0)$ 与 $B(0, -1)$ 等距，即 $[AB]$ 的 \\emph{中垂线}。", "", "\\emph{(b)} 距离为 $3$ 的点（参照点为 $(1,1)$）构成 \\emph{圆}，", "圆心为 $1 + \\iu$，半径为 $3$。", "", "\\emph{(c)} 由 \\cref{prop:g12:complex:geometry}(4)，$\\frac{z-1}{z+1}$ 为纯", "虚数，即从 $A(1,0)$ 到 $M$ 的向量与从 $B(-1,0)$ 到 $M$ 的向量", "正交，即 $M$ 对线段 $[AB]$ 张直角。所求集合为", "\\emph{以 $[AB]$ 为直径的圆}（即单位圆）\\emph{去掉", "点 $A$ 与 $B$ 本身}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:5}", "棣莫弗公式：$\\cos3\\theta + \\iu\\sin3\\theta = (\\cos\\theta + \\iu\\sin\\theta)^3$。", "由二项式定理展开，记 $c = \\cos\\theta$，$s = \\sin\\theta$：", "\\[", "(c + \\iu s)^3 = c^3 + 3\\iu c^2 s - 3 c s^2 - \\iu s^3", "= (c^3 - 3cs^2) + \\iu(3c^2 s - s^3).", "\\]", "比较实部与虚部，并利用 $s^2 = 1 - c^2$，$c^2 = 1 - s^2$：", "\\[", "\\cos3\\theta = 4\\cos^3\\theta - 3\\cos\\theta,", "\\qquad", "\\sin3\\theta = 3\\sin\\theta - 4\\sin^3\\theta .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:6}", "\\[", "\\cos^3\\theta = \\left(\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} + \\eu^{-\\iu\\theta}}{2}\\right)^{\\!3}", "= \\frac{\\eu^{3\\iu\\theta} + 3\\eu^{\\iu\\theta} + 3\\eu^{-\\iu\\theta} + \\eu^{-3\\iu\\theta}}{8}", "= \\frac{\\cos3\\theta + 3\\cos\\theta}{4}.", "\\]", "由此", "\\[", "\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^3\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta", "= \\frac14\\left[\\frac{\\sin3\\theta}{3} + 3\\sin\\theta\\right]_0^{\\pi/2}", "= \\frac14\\left(-\\frac13 + 3\\right) = \\frac{2}{3}.", "\\]", "（与 \\cref{exo:g12:integ:9} 中的 $W_3 = \\frac23$ 一致，因为", "$\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^3 = \\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^3$，由对称性", "$\\theta \\mapsto \\frac\\pi2 - \\theta$ 得到）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:7}", "$c = a + \\eu^{\\pm\\iu\\pi/3}(b - a)$，其中 $b - a = 2 + \\iu$，且", "$\\eu^{\\pm\\iu\\pi/3} = \\frac12 \\pm \\iu\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$：", "\\[", "\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/3}(2+\\iu) = \\left(\\tfrac12 + \\iu\\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\right)(2+\\iu)", "= \\left(1 - \\tfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\right) + \\iu\\left(\\tfrac12 + \\sqrt3\\right),", "\\]", "于是 $c_1 = \\left(2 - \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\right) +", "\\iu\\left(\\frac32 + \\sqrt3\\right)$，类似地，取辐角", "$-\\frac\\pi3$：", "$c_2 = \\left(2 + \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\right) + \\iu\\left(\\frac32 - \\sqrt3\\right)$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:complex:8}", "$-4 = 4\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\pi}$，故方程 $z^4 = -4$ 的解为", "\\[", "z_k = \\sqrt2\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\left(\\frac\\pi4 + \\frac{k\\pi}{2}\\right)},", "\\quad k = 0, 1, 2, 3,", "\\]", "\\emph{即} $1 + \\iu$、$-1 + \\iu$、$-1 - \\iu$、$1 - \\iu$，它们是", "外接圆半径为 $\\sqrt 2$ 的正方形的顶点。将共轭根两两分组，", "\\[", "z^4 + 4 = \\bigl(z - (1{+}\\iu)\\bigr)\\bigl(z - (1{-}\\iu)\\bigr)", "\\bigl(z + (1{-}\\iu)\\bigr)\\bigl(z + (1{+}\\iu)\\bigr)", "= (z^2 - 2z + 2)(z^2 + 2z + 2).", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", ""]}